PROJECT: Aptos
Official Name: Aptos
Symbol: APT
Category: Layer 1 blockchain / smart contract platform
Founding Entity: Aptos Labs Inc., Delaware, USA
Founders: Mo Shaikh (CEO); Avery Ching (CTO)
Core Team: 100+ karyawan (berdasarkan profil LinkedIn Aptos Labs), tim inti tidak diungkap sepenuhnya
Country: USA
Launch Date - Testnet: 2022-03-28 (Aptos Incentivized Testnet 1)
Launch Date - Mainnet: 2022-10-17
Launch Date - TGE: 2022-10-19
Main Products: Aptos Blockchain (Layer 1); Move programming language; Aptos Wallet (official); Aptos Explorer; Aptos SDK/TS/Unity/Python; Petra Wallet (ecosystem wallet); Pontem Wallet (ecosystem wallet)
Official Website: https://aptoslabs.com
Repository: https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core
Documentation: https://aptos.dev
Social - X/Twitter: @aptoslabs
Social - Discord: https://discord.gg/aptoslabs
Social - Telegram: @aptosofficial
Block Explorer: https://explorer.aptoslabs.com
Token Contract: 0x1::aptos_coin::AptosCoin (native coin, Move module pada chain Aptos)
Chain(s): Aptos (native); Ethereum (via wormhole/layerzero bridging); Arbitrum; Optimism; Base; Polygon; Solana (via bridging)
Ecosystem: Move ecosystem; DeFi (Thala, Amnis, Cellana); NFT (Topaz, BlueMove); Gaming; Infrastructure (LayerZero, Wormhole, Pyth, Switchboard)

